{
    "word": "deadfall",
    "lang_code": "en",
    "source_file_to_entries": {
        "raw-wiktextract-data.jsonl": [
            {
                "entry_id": "7104a3dd-824c-3a2a-810f-8e2d6e38d0d1",
                "word": "deadfall",
                "pos": "noun",
                "lang_code": "en",
                "forms": [
                    {
                        "form_id": "15cd3108-7dc2-49e5-a90c-02bf48e0c1ba",
                        "entry_id": "7104a3dd-824c-3a2a-810f-8e2d6e38d0d1",
                        "tags": [
                            "plural"
                        ],
                        "form": "deadfalls"
                    }
                ],
                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "5924f16c-380f-37f6-b1e7-6521d545bf3e",
                        "entry_id": "7104a3dd-824c-3a2a-810f-8e2d6e38d0d1",
                        "glosses": [
                            "Coarse woody debris; deadwood."
                        ],
                        "tags": [
                            "Canada",
                            "US",
                            "uncountable"
                        ],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "f2805be8-54b5-48e6-9856-9dfa476ad5b4",
                                "sense_id": "5924f16c-380f-37f6-b1e7-6521d545bf3e",
                                "text": "Heaver forest growth on the north-facing slopes, together with considerable deadfall and soil cover, makes geologic interpretation there difficult."
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "c30c9478-8972-3dc8-a2bf-8776491158c6",
                        "entry_id": "7104a3dd-824c-3a2a-810f-8e2d6e38d0d1",
                        "glosses": [
                            "Coarse woody debris; deadwood.",
                            "A fallen tree."
                        ],
                        "tags": [
                            "Canada",
                            "US",
                            "countable",
                            "specifically"
                        ],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "5f454b52-7875-4da1-b83d-91ed6c8e67c2",
                                "sense_id": "c30c9478-8972-3dc8-a2bf-8776491158c6",
                                "text": "A fifth negative test pit was excavated near the largest creek at Middle Point. As well, the roots of all deadfalls within the corridor were examined for the presence of cultural material. Deadfalls were more common in the drier areas, especially near stream channels."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "fab847d6-fe69-449f-bc41-e383f9192387",
                                "sense_id": "c30c9478-8972-3dc8-a2bf-8776491158c6",
                                "text": "We should go up to the forest and see if we can find more dry deadfalls. That green wood you were trying to burn last night was all smoke and no heat."
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "8ece1b0c-7663-3797-8477-8fda012d6791",
                        "entry_id": "7104a3dd-824c-3a2a-810f-8e2d6e38d0d1",
                        "glosses": [
                            "A kind of trap for animals, consisting of a heavy board or log that falls on to the prey."
                        ],
                        "tags": [
                            "Canada",
                            "US",
                            "countable"
                        ],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "838e0765-54f9-448f-8cf0-9ee9272d43e8",
                                "sense_id": "8ece1b0c-7663-3797-8477-8fda012d6791",
                                "text": "It [the wolverine] is so cunning as rarely to enter a deadfall itself, but will carefully pull it to pieces and then eat the bait in safety. I was informed by hunters at Selkirk Settlement that they sometimes lost the successful result of several days' trapping by a single wolverine, which, following their path, would pull down every deadfall, or destroy any animal already caught."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "b8cd8aaf-8bb4-4b0a-881b-61e4f823dd3d",
                                "sense_id": "8ece1b0c-7663-3797-8477-8fda012d6791",
                                "text": "The beaver trap is a deadfall of considerable weight, nicely adjusted over the animal's road or track, frequently on a dam. […] The animal passing under the deadfall has to step on a little stick raised an inch or two above the ground, and this brings down the deadfall on its back."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "e9014c11-3d07-4c5b-9f25-673a015e0789",
                                "sense_id": "8ece1b0c-7663-3797-8477-8fda012d6791",
                                "text": "It was a week after the taking of the black fox that Skookum Bill, on a short exploring trip a few miles west of their cabin, came across a deadfall which held a dead marten. He took the marten, and, when he returned, said to Dobbs: \"I didn't know you'd built any deadfalls in the timber past the big draw?\""
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "4f125ee5-a478-40a3-8fde-0d718f80fbcb",
                                "sense_id": "8ece1b0c-7663-3797-8477-8fda012d6791",
                                "text": "Marten, wolverine, lynx, ermine, fox, mink, beaver, and land otter were plentiful in the general vicinity of Kijik and traps and deadfalls were set for them."
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "a126a33a-9b5d-3cb5-b9cc-585c443f711e",
                        "entry_id": "7104a3dd-824c-3a2a-810f-8e2d6e38d0d1",
                        "glosses": [
                            "A cheap, rough bar or saloon."
                        ],
                        "tags": [
                            "US",
                            "countable",
                            "slang"
                        ],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "ef9b8aa7-b160-4d50-ba1a-777e9b83c605",
                                "sense_id": "a126a33a-9b5d-3cb5-b9cc-585c443f711e",
                                "text": "Dens of the description of the \"Tapis Franc,\" and the \"deadfalls\" of San Francisco and Sacramento, are now matters of history only, and it seems beyond the bounds of probability that similar haunts of vice, and the brutal and lawless scenes there enacted, will ever again be permitted to disgrace our country, and the name of civilization."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "8bf34f50-fc9b-49cd-b929-9cc8bcc68412",
                                "sense_id": "a126a33a-9b5d-3cb5-b9cc-585c443f711e",
                                "text": "[…] I was an occasional dram-drinker at their saloon. I was never imposed upon by them with bad liquor, nor in any manner cheated there. I did not learn they kept loaded dice, marked cards, or any back-room \"deadfall\"—to rake the pockets of fuddled or drugged customers."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "760696f7-c668-4d19-be17-87f88517f658",
                                "sense_id": "a126a33a-9b5d-3cb5-b9cc-585c443f711e",
                                "text": "They had lived down in horse barns, army “A” tents with the old blood-stains onto them, city hotels with canopy beds, woke up in back rooms of deadfalls where the bars had toothmarks end to end."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
                "translations": [
                    {
                        "translation_id": "c31a8230-7cbf-40d6-9890-7b6bb6f62054",
                        "source_entry_id": "7104a3dd-824c-3a2a-810f-8e2d6e38d0d1",
                        "source_sense_description": "coarse woody debris — see also deadwood",
                        "target_lang_word": "вале́жник",
                        "target_lang_code": "ru",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "вале́жник",
                                "target_lang_code": "ru",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "e8b3b9f7-04f7-3ae3-b54d-937203fdd6cf",
                                        "entry_id": "3b4a86e9-547e-340d-b282-b3d59bc9dd9a",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "сухие или гнилые сучья, деревья, лежащие на земле"
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "847e2f64-0d0b-406a-ae1d-e83293ff6251",
                                                "sense_id": "e8b3b9f7-04f7-3ae3-b54d-937203fdd6cf",
                                                "text": "Кедровые сучья, перемешанные с валежником, с покалеченным, искорёженным молодняком, повсюду высились в завалах — не перелезть…"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "c4b42e03-5fde-4321-8920-20f6634a27a7",
                                                "sense_id": "e8b3b9f7-04f7-3ae3-b54d-937203fdd6cf",
                                                "text": "Вскоре валежник затрещал под ногами проводника, и он вышел на тропу с веткой лавровишни, густо усеянной гроздьями ягод."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "df72758d-8c50-4978-9e43-6493f3afecf7",
                                                "sense_id": "e8b3b9f7-04f7-3ae3-b54d-937203fdd6cf",
                                                "text": "А Егор упоённо чистил лес, прорубал заросшие просеки, стаскивал в кучи валежник и сухостой."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "fc79237d-02f4-4b97-9cc6-9723a909da85",
                        "source_entry_id": "7104a3dd-824c-3a2a-810f-8e2d6e38d0d1",
                        "source_sense_description": "coarse woody debris — see also deadwood",
                        "target_lang_word": "вале́ж",
                        "target_lang_code": "ru",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "вале́ж",
                                "target_lang_code": "ru",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "3a6956f5-141e-3f74-8a76-b105f5f5d800",
                                        "entry_id": "ea7ae725-f4da-3aad-8531-95c93a744466",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "собир. то же, что валежник"
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "db38e243-bf74-4553-b191-eb98215b0e26",
                                                "sense_id": "3a6956f5-141e-3f74-8a76-b105f5f5d800",
                                                "text": "Источённые жуком, подпалённые молнией мертвецы стоят там в моховых погребальных шубах, опершись на плечи живых, и путнику приходится врукопашную прорываться там сквозь валеж и комариные облака, как в стародавние годы…"
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "c58d750a-b241-41fd-bbb1-4667f47288ce",
                        "source_entry_id": "7104a3dd-824c-3a2a-810f-8e2d6e38d0d1",
                        "source_sense_description": "coarse woody debris — see also deadwood",
                        "target_lang_word": "бурело́м",
                        "target_lang_code": "ru",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "бурело́м",
                                "target_lang_code": "ru",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "98b64d23-820e-3c75-afca-43da7698eabe",
                                        "entry_id": "e61774d4-d781-3325-9a52-b7eeffa39120",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "собир. сломанные или поваленные бурей деревья"
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "ca332118-fa35-40f4-a4ec-578ae6bbaef4",
                                                "sense_id": "98b64d23-820e-3c75-afca-43da7698eabe",
                                                "text": "Подступил берег левый — лесистый, песчаный, с обрывистыми подмывами, с буреломом."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "3576afe2-0467-3af1-bbaf-3894f7119e98",
                                        "entry_id": "e61774d4-d781-3325-9a52-b7eeffa39120",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "участок леса, заваленный такими деревьями"
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "41b58eb4-0f9b-49dc-870c-49c5de0e27d3",
                                                "sense_id": "3576afe2-0467-3af1-bbaf-3894f7119e98",
                                                "text": "Надо было начинать работать, надо было пробивать бурелом просекой."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "2001b961-c16d-3fc1-bde0-0c6908890d2f",
                                        "entry_id": "e61774d4-d781-3325-9a52-b7eeffa39120",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "перен., поэт. беспорядок, неразбериха"
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "60ba9019-bad5-42f3-939a-52f75cdd11d5",
                                                "sense_id": "2001b961-c16d-3fc1-bde0-0c6908890d2f",
                                                "text": "Однако путь к пониманию простых ответов загромождает понятийный бурелом, завалы и засеки из штампов сознания и стереотипов действия."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "73b94d32-f61b-4810-b40e-8acd311899ef",
                                                "sense_id": "2001b961-c16d-3fc1-bde0-0c6908890d2f",
                                                "text": "Паспорт мой сгорел когда-то // В буреломе русских бед. // Он теперь дымок заката…"
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "8fba88d0-7334-4dc4-8f19-77a67c74c066",
                        "source_entry_id": "7104a3dd-824c-3a2a-810f-8e2d6e38d0d1",
                        "source_sense_description": "fallen tree",
                        "target_lang_word": "chablis",
                        "target_lang_code": "fr",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "chablis",
                                "target_lang_code": "fr",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "cd12d23b-ba90-3cb2-8608-8b154ff1c21e",
                                        "entry_id": "b22a5dc9-d8a3-393d-9ea7-59f8446ffb9c",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Bois abattu par le vent ou qui est tombé de vétusté dans une forêt."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "369ef88c-09e6-497a-ab51-edee244be7dd",
                                                "sense_id": "cd12d23b-ba90-3cb2-8608-8b154ff1c21e",
                                                "text": "Les chablis issus des tempêtes de 1999 ont d’abord été colonisés par des insectes xylophages puis par des champignons lignivores qui ont dégradé la valeur des bois."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "548cdfbb-40bc-41fa-93ff-6850473f2d9d",
                                                "sense_id": "cd12d23b-ba90-3cb2-8608-8b154ff1c21e",
                                                "text": "Lors du martelage des parcelles sinistrées, le gestionnaire peut être amené à marteler une tige non touchée s’il considère qu’elle est sans avenir compte-tenu des dégâts dans le peuplement qui l'entoure ou que son abattage est rendu nécessaire pour l’exploitation des chablis."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "019ccde8-faad-4cd1-83f6-948fb87692ec",
                                                "sense_id": "cd12d23b-ba90-3cb2-8608-8b154ff1c21e",
                                                "text": "Il ne s’agit en fait pas d’une altération, mais de l’emplacement de l’ancien ensouchement ou de brins englobés par la nouvelle tige, et qui se sont progressivement décomposés. Même si ces arbres sont probablement un peu plus sensibles aux risques de chablis, la présence de telles cavités ne justifie donc pas leur enlèvement."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "af26295a-a480-4cca-a7f2-40a632d61896",
                                                "sense_id": "cd12d23b-ba90-3cb2-8608-8b154ff1c21e",
                                                "text": "Pour atteindre Dobbiaco il fallut deux heures de gymnastique dans une forêt de souches enfouies. On rampa sous les chablis, on franchit des mikados de racines."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "6b272df4-b51d-3c38-91f4-a0ae8af27fd4",
                                        "entry_id": "b22a5dc9-d8a3-393d-9ea7-59f8446ffb9c",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Tout arbre malade ou mort, dont l’exploitation n’est pas planifiée dans l’aménagement."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "broadly"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "16d1e4a2-f304-4654-934e-74da387cdf18",
                                                "sense_id": "6b272df4-b51d-3c38-91f4-a0ae8af27fd4",
                                                "text": "As-tu fini l’exploitation des chablis scolytés dans la parcelle 41 ?"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "fa79ccbe-8661-435a-a9bb-78ac33b08b37",
                                                "sense_id": "6b272df4-b51d-3c38-91f4-a0ae8af27fd4",
                                                "text": "En Allemagne, la tempête de cet hiver a fait 15 millions de m³ de chablis, la sécheresse et l’épidémie de bostryche portent ce volume à deux fois plus."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "665c7dc1-3139-3cc8-ad14-7e3846f58a34",
                                        "entry_id": "b22a5dc9-d8a3-393d-9ea7-59f8446ffb9c",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Vin blanc sec produit dans la région de Chablis, en Bourgogne."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "d4b7c208-7289-487f-a0ec-4274737d19be",
                                                "sense_id": "665c7dc1-3139-3cc8-ad14-7e3846f58a34",
                                                "text": "Les bouteilles de chablis, coupées de moût, éclatèrent d’elles-mêmes."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "c7b332a3-1be7-496a-9cb7-8cd15c69981c",
                                                "sense_id": "665c7dc1-3139-3cc8-ad14-7e3846f58a34",
                                                "text": "Au lieu d’une bouteille, ils m’en apportèrent trois : Chablis, Pouilly, Irancy."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "8405d6f9-bbdd-42a3-bddd-8615c026412a",
                                                "sense_id": "665c7dc1-3139-3cc8-ad14-7e3846f58a34",
                                                "text": "Le serveur polonais déposa devant eux une bouteille de chablis tiède.\n« Ils n’y arrivent pas… » geignit le romancier. « Ils n’arrivent pas à servir le vin blanc à température. »"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "c2e50942-12ae-40b2-8759-efd5c19f45d5",
                                                "sense_id": "665c7dc1-3139-3cc8-ad14-7e3846f58a34",
                                                "text": "Il y avait de la Volvic et du chablis."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "e754519c-4d06-3f9e-a7e6-6ef657da5197",
                                        "entry_id": "b22a5dc9-d8a3-393d-9ea7-59f8446ffb9c",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Synonyme de chardonnay blanc."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "Viticulture"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "c2c958cc-4e4d-488c-bcda-9ae5acbaf630",
                                                "sense_id": "e754519c-4d06-3f9e-a7e6-6ef657da5197",
                                                "text": "Planter en chablis."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
